title: workspace:fork
tags: [[GUI command]] Workspaces
kind: reference
summary: Open a copy of this workspace in a new tab

Opens a new workspace identical to the one the command runs in: the same repository,
a copy of every [[workspace variable|Workspace variables]] and the same panels, so it
shows what this one shows — the same query in the list, the same folder in the file
manager. From then on the two are separate. A [[value picker|Value picker]] is not
forked: the copy would answer the same form a second time. See [[Workspaces]].
